<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Chat Completions on Fragments of Logic</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/tags/chat-completions/</link><description>Recent content in Chat Completions on Fragments of Logic</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/tags/chat-completions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>深入 OpenAI Chat Completions：从 ChatCompletionCreateParams 到 SSE 流式响应</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%85%A5openai-chat-completions%E4%BB%8Echatcompletioncreateparams%E5%88%B0sse%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%93%8D%E5%BA%94/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%85%A5openai-chat-completions%E4%BB%8Echatcompletioncreateparams%E5%88%B0sse%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%93%8D%E5%BA%94/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;当你第一次用代码调用 &lt;code&gt;gpt-4o&lt;/code&gt; 时，最先遇到的往往不是一个&amp;quot;模型&amp;quot;，而是一长串需要填对的参数：模型 ID 填什么？消息数组怎么组织？要不要开流式传输？这些问题的答案，都藏在 OpenAI 官方 SDK 的核心类型 &lt;code&gt;ChatCompletionCreateParams&lt;/code&gt; 和它背后那个最常被调用的接口 &lt;code&gt;/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; 之中。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>